      "reviewed": "2026-11-03",
      "notes": "ArcGIS Online item 09cf47e1cf82465e99164762a04f3ce6 'VT Data - Statewide Standardized Parcel Data - parcel polygons' (owner Services_VCGI), feature service services1.arcgis.com/BkFxaEFNwHqX3tAw/arcgis/rest/services/FS_VCGI_OPENDATA_Cadastral_VTPARCELS_poly_standardized_parcels_SP_v1/FeatureServer/0 (maxRecordCount 2,000). Active parcels with the municipal Grand List joined on SPAN, updated weekly, content year varies by town. The files are 11 pages (OBJECTID order, geometry off) of the polygons with CAT in C, CA, I and PROPTYPE = PARCEL (20,400 polygons, 19,342 distinct SPANs). CAT is the Vermont Department of Taxes grand list category: C commercial -> F1, CA commercial apartment -> B, I industrial -> F2 (definitions and statewide counts: Department of Taxes presentation 'H.480: Property Categories in the Grand list', 2023-04-14). The layer has no county column: the adapter maps the TOWN name to a county with VCGI's town boundary layer (item 3f464b0e1980450e9026430a635bff0a, fields TOWNNAME and CNTY). robots.txt: services1.arcgis.com serves none (403 'Invalid URL'); geodata.vermont.gov (Crawl-delay 60) and the Hub download API were not used; vcgi.vermont.gov and maps.vcgi.vermont.gov (documents read once each) allow the pages read."
